## Building

```sh
west build -b {{ board }} app
```

A port of this shape has been built: an nRF52840 with a DHT22 and a button
linked to 34288 B of flash against Zephyr v4.4.2, with Zephyr's own `dht_api`
in the binary. **This particular port has not**, and building is not running:
nothing here has been on hardware, so the pin numbers, the active level and
the pull are still only as good as the answers they came from.
